## 4. Conclusion
Nucleus is not just "working"; it is **generating compounding value**.
The Critic finding bugs in [contact/page.tsx](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/nucleus-hud/app/contact/page.tsx) (Accessibility) proves that the system protects against agent degradation.

### Next Step Recommendation
